{"appid": 1546970, "package_id": 817628, "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/api/packagedetails?packageids=817628&cc=us&l=english", "attempt": 1, "http_status": 200, "response_date": "Thu, 12 Nov 2026 05:54:26 GMT", "cache_age_seconds": null, "body": {"817628": {"success": true, "data": {"name": "Grand Theft Auto: The Trilogy – The Definitive Edition", "page_content": "Three iconic cities, three epic stories. \r\n\r\nPlay the genre-defining classics of the original trilogy updated for a new generation — now with across-the-board enhancements including brilliant new lighting and environmental upgrades, high-resolution textures, increased draw distances, Grand Theft Auto V-style controls and targeting, and much more.\r\n\r\nGrand Theft Auto: The Trilogy – The Definitive Edition includes: \r\n\r\n•\tGrand Theft Auto III: It all starts in Liberty City. With the revolutionary freedom to go anywhere and jack anyone, Grand Theft Auto III puts the center of the criminal underworld at your fingertips, if you have enough guts to take it.\r\n\r\n•\tGrand Theft Auto: Vice City: Welcome to the 1980s. From the decade of big hair and pastel suits comes the story of one man’s rise to the top of the criminal pile. Grand Theft Auto returns with Tommy Vercetti’s tale of betrayal and revenge in a neon-soaked tropical town full of excess and brimming with possibilities.\r\n\r\n•\tGrand Theft Auto: San Andreas: It’s the early ’90s in Los Santos, a city tearing itself apart. Framed for homicide, Carl “CJ” Johnson is forced on a journey that takes him across the entire state of San Andreas, in an attempt to save his family and to take control of the streets. ", "page_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/subs/817628/header.jpg?t=1752520763", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/subs/817628/header_ratio.jpg?t=1752520763", "small_logo": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/subs/817628/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752520763", "apps": [{"id": 1546970, "name": "Grand Theft Auto III – The Definitive Edition"}, {"id": 1547000, "name": "Grand Theft Auto: San Andreas – The Definitive Edition"}, {"id": 1546990, "name": "Grand Theft Auto: Vice City – The Definitive Edition"}], "price": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 5999, "final": 1979, "discount_percent": 67, "individual": 0}, "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "controller": {"full_gamepad": true}, "release_date": {"coming_soon": false, "date": ""}}}}, "observed_at_utc": "2026-11-12T05:54:26+00:00"}
